        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>6 Foot Satin Stainless Steel Ladder Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 60 Inch Center to Center Round Stainless Steel Ladder Pull is perfect for large doors and will add a touch of modern design to any space. At 72 inches overall (6 feet) this pull is large, but it still has a very comfortable 1-1/4 inch pull diameter so large and small hands can get a comfortable grip. It has a satin stainless steel finish which is as low-maintenance as you can get making it a great choice for high traffic doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounted, back-to-back mounted, or surface mounted for wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/ada-compliant-60-inch-round-ladder-pull\"><b>ADA Compliant 60 Inch Round Ladder Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-19R60-size.gif?v=1704354573\" width=\"580\" height=\"149\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-CAN-19R60EB-32D Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Contemporary 6 Foot Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\" (6 feet)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 60\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 3-23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 1-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA Compliant</b></a></li>\r\n<li>Optional mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly 8 Left.\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "60 Inch Center to Center Round Stainless Steel Ladder Pull",
